msgstr "PC5的INSTALL文件夹中有%d款游戏等待安装。现在安装吗？从那里安装的游戏会从INSTALL文件夹移入PC5的游戏库。"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7605
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d games are waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install them now? A game "
